BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Data\, Cloud and AI in Mexico City|IBM Bob TV episode 3: Benchmark
 ing optimization tasks\, cost & quality with Bob|Online
DTSTART:20261104T040000
CATEGORIES:ai,cloud,data,web
DESCRIPTION:Data\, Cloud and AI in Mexico City\nJoin us for the third epis
 ode of **Bob TV\,** the monthly digital event series hosted by **Max Jesch
 **\, IBM Bob’s outbound product manager. Each month\, Max sits down with
  a technical guest to explore real examples of your trusted AI assistant i
 n action—showing how **Bob** accelerates enterprise software development
  across the entire lifecycle.\n\n**Featuring Special Guest: Rynne Whitnah*
 *\n\nWe’re thrilled to welcome Rynne Whitnah\, Technical Lead AI Ecosyst
 em at IBM to the November installment.\n\n**Rynne will cover:**\n\n* How d
 evelopers can benchmark optimization tasks to benchmark cost & quality\n* 
 How to increase effectiveness of prompting and MCP servers at lowest possi
 ble cost\n* Bobalytics - additional ways to maximize token use\n\n**Bob TV
  is your monthly window into:**\n\n* Bob capabilities\n* AI‑assisted dev
 elopment workflows\n* Enterprise modernization patterns\n* Agent‑based s
 oftware engineering\n\n**Host:**\n\n**![](https://cache.webcasts.com/conte
 nt/ibmx001/1771850/content/8605de84345dc42143086f23cfcb2d55984805ea/common
 /Screenshot20260803at1.28.53PM.png)**\n\n**Maximilian Jesch\,** Outbound P
 roduct Manager\, IBM Bob\n\n![](https://cache.webcasts.com/content/ibmx001
 /1778678/content/bcc46111dcd862aa529fb2d57d0f81cb3076048a/common/image198.
 png)\n\n**Rynne Whitnah\,** Technical Lead\, AI Ecosystem\, IBM
LOCATION:Online event\,
END:VEVENT
